">Makes Hair Softer, Stronger, and Silkier: The combination of pure coconut oil and aloe vera extracts provides quality nourishment to the hair, resulting in stronger, softer, and silkier locks.</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(86, 143, 86); font-family: &quot;PT Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\\">Goodness of Coconut Oil: Coconut oil penetrates 10X deeper into the hair and scalp, strengthening them from the core and promoting overall hair health.</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(86, 143, 86); font-family: &quot;PT Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\\">Suitable for All Hair Types: Whether you have straight, curly, thin, thick, fine, or textured hair, this is suitable for all hair types</span></li></ul><span style=\\"color: rgb(86, 143, 86); font-family: &quot;PT Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\\"><b>How To Use:</b> This product is for external use only. To properly use, take a few drops of the hair into your hands. Rub your palms together and gently massage into the hair. Use Parachute Advanced Aloe Vera at least thrice a week for best results.</span>","originalPrice":640,"shortDescription":"<ul><li>A<span style=\\"color: rgb(86, 143, 86); font-family: &quot;PT Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\\">dvansed Product Benefits: Strong, Soft, Silky Hair</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(86, 143, 86); font-family: &quot;PT Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\\">Item Form: Oil Material</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(86, 143, 86); font-family: &quot;PT Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\\">Type Free: Sulphate Free</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(86, 143, 86); font-family: &quot;PT Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\\">Scent: Coconut</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(86, 143, 86); font-family: &quot;PT Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\\">Hair Type: All Hair Types</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(86, 143, 86); font-family: &quot;PT Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\\">Liquid Volume: 500 ml</span></li><li><span style=\\"color: rgb(86, 143, 86); font-family: &quot;PT Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\\">Special Feature: Contains Aloe Vera &amp; Coconut</span></li></ul>"}]', 'MYORDER', '2025-12-24T11:16:06.699+00:00', '2025-12-24T11:16:06.53036+00:00') ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE `id`=`id`;
